  o Minor bugfixes (onion service directory):
    - On HSDirs, count an onion service descriptor as downloaded only once its
      response has been handed to the client's stream, not whenever the request
      closes, so that requesting a descriptor and closing the stream or circuit
      at once no longer protects it from cache pruning. Bugfix on 0.4.8.14;
      related to ticket 41339.
